(7017408, 1063628, 30861, '<td valign="top">If only you could have processed it better :-( The halo is KILLING you, and it''s not hard to get rid of. Feel free to ask me how, if you wish...</td>', 'If only you could have processed it better :-( The halo is KILLING you, and it''s not hard to get rid of. Feel free to ask me how, if you wish...', '2013-04-10 01:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
