(7019311, 1062964, 67258, '<td valign="top">Superb rendition of the texture.  There seems to be a slight greenish-yellow cast, which may be a by-product of the light at the time, but I would have been tempted to adjust slightly.  I would be interested to see this in a mono or duo tone, too.  Very good work.</td>', 'Superb rendition of the texture.  There seems to be a slight greenish-yellow cast, which may be a by-product of the light at the time, but I would have been tempted to adjust slightly.  I would be interested to see this in a mono or duo tone, too.  Very good work.', '2013-04-13 03:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
