(7020943, 1063157, 18367, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo and do hope you do well in the challenge.  On a personal note, assuming that the photo had more image content on the left, I would have included all the the child''s shadow, more of the bridge and would have cropped out the gentleman and his bike entirely.<br/> <br/>But that''s just a personal preference.<br/> <br/>Very nicely done... 8</td>', 'I really like this photo and do hope you do well in the challenge.  On a personal note, assuming that the photo had more image content on the left, I would have included all the the child''s shadow, more of the bridge and would have cropped out the gentleman and his bike entirely. But that''s just a personal preference. Very nicely done... 8', '2013-04-15 19:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
