(7021443, 1063072, 3102, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to sound particularly harsh here, but this doesn''t grab me as being particularly artistic, given the clutter in the background and placement of the bikes.  This almost seems like "Hey! Bikes!  That will fit the challenge!"  So it comes across to me as being more like the challenge was a scavenger hunt for something that fit the topic, rather than something compelling photographically.  Hopefully this makes sense, rather than just sounding like a rant :)</td>', 'I don''t want to sound particularly harsh here, but this doesn''t grab me as being particularly artistic, given the clutter in the background and placement of the bikes.  This almost seems like "Hey! Bikes!  That will fit the challenge!"  So it comes across to me as being more like the challenge was a scavenger hunt for something that fit the topic, rather than something compelling photographically.  Hopefully this makes sense, rather than just sounding like a rant :)', '2013-04-16 15:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
