(7021648, 1063609, 29490, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this photo - I see me in 25 years, sitting with my love.  We come here nearly everyday, sit and feed the birds, watch the ducks, watch the people.  We talk.  We are happy.<br/> <br/>Then that <i>punk</i> parked her bike right in front of us.  I shout, "Get off my lawn." She counters with "Suck it, old man!"<br/> <br/>Then it hits me that I am an old man and I forgot that <b>I</b> rode the bike.  I apologize to the girl and she responds with a digital salute.<br/> <br/>Yes - I can relate to this photo.  <br/> <br/>10</td>', 'I really enjoy this photo - I see me in 25 years, sitting with my love.  We come here nearly everyday, sit and feed the birds, watch the ducks, watch the people.  We talk.  We are happy. Then that punk parked her bike right in front of us.  I shout, "Get off my lawn." She counters with "Suck it, old man!" Then it hits me that I am an old man and I forgot that I rode the bike.  I apologize to the girl and she responds with a digital salute. Yes - I can relate to this photo.   10', '2013-04-16 20:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
