(7022274, 1063549, 28276, '<td valign="top">I think this was a great idea for a shot and fairly well executed (I had a similar idea, but went another direction)  You had great technical on the sharpness of the bike frame against the motion blur, I think.<br/> <br/>What I think kept this from being really great were a few distracting details:  the cable in the foreground, a fairly distracting background, and a loss of detail in the handle bar area.  A nice blue sky would have helped, as well.<br/> <br/>Over all, a really nice capture.</td>', 'I think this was a great idea for a shot and fairly well executed (I had a similar idea, but went another direction)  You had great technical on the sharpness of the bike frame against the motion blur, I think. What I think kept this from being really great were a few distracting details:  the cable in the foreground, a fairly distracting background, and a loss of detail in the handle bar area.  A nice blue sky would have helped, as well. Over all, a really nice capture.', '2013-04-17 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
