(7022466, 1063500, 28276, '<td valign="top">This is just funny and I like it.   Score''s lower than I can explain, but I''ll not pick a little. <br/> <br/>There are a couple of spots with poor focus/motion blur  the wheels and under the "arm".   These distract a little. <br/> <br/>Lighting feels flat, somehow.  Maybe flat isn''t right.  It''s like a fake film effect was used.  Like it was taken on an overcast day.  <br/> <br/>I think they knew who it was...  And expected more?<br/> <br/>Hope that helps...<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is just funny and I like it.   Score''s lower than I can explain, but I''ll not pick a little.  There are a couple of spots with poor focus/motion blur  the wheels and under the "arm".   These distract a little.  Lighting feels flat, somehow.  Maybe flat isn''t right.  It''s like a fake film effect was used.  Like it was taken on an overcast day.   I think they knew who it was...  And expected more? Hope that helps... ', '2013-04-17 20:05:57.000000', NULL, 0),
