(7027810, 1063010, 159528, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyStreet:</b></div><hr/><i> He looks like he means business! I''m enjoying your edgy composition. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Penny. This is not one of my best,in fact I don''t like the shot too much. But I couldn''t come with something better because of lacking of time.</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyStreet: He looks like he means business! I''m enjoying your edgy composition.   Thank you Penny. This is not one of my best,in fact I don''t like the shot too much. But I couldn''t come with something better because of lacking of time.', '2013-04-27 10:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7033770, 1063196, 16106, '<td valign="top">It is a rare thing for me to get exactly the shot I wanted without doing a setup. This image is exactly what I hoped to get and the eye contact was a bonus.<br/> <br/>I really would have liked to know why this was worthy of a 1. Hint, the bicycle is in the center, in front of the trees if you missed it. <br/> <br/>I throw in crap just to have an entry and it scores well. But this bombs. Sigh.</td>', 'It is a rare thing for me to get exactly the shot I wanted without doing a setup. This image is exactly what I hoped to get and the eye contact was a bonus. I really would have liked to know why this was worthy of a 1. Hint, the bicycle is in the center, in front of the trees if you missed it.  I throw in crap just to have an entry and it scores well. But this bombs. Sigh.', '2013-05-07 16:26:36.000000', NULL, 0),
